-- The frame kinds and their shares in thousandths (design EL3b "The feed is a mix"): painted live
-- is the minority and the only kind that spends; a live slot that cannot paint shows the library.
export pure func feedKinds() -> [(string, int)] = [("live", 200), ("library", 400), ("card", 200), ("snapshot", 100), ("sky", 100)]
